    "best": "Auto rickshaw or Ola/Uber for most trips; walk the Old City on foot.",
    "modes": [
      {
        "mode": "Metro",
        "has": false,
        "text": "No metro yet. Don't plan around rail inside the city."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "text": "AMTS city buses and BRTS (Janmarg) buses run roughly 6AM–11PM. AMTS fares about ₹3–25; a ₹45 day pass exists but is rarely worth it. BRTS bus 1000 links the airport and Karnavati Club, max fare ₹50, every 30 min."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "Ola and Uber work, plus local taxi apps. Auto rickshaws are cheap; agree the fare first or use the prepaid booth at the airport."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Possible, but driving is hectic. Most visitors do better with autos and app cabs."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "Best way to explore the Old City lanes. Use cycle rickshaws for short hops."
      }
    ]
